                    <TablixCell />
                  </TablixCells>
                </TablixRow>
                <TablixRow>
                  <Height>0.40994in</Height>
                  <TablixCells>
                    <TablixCell>
                      <CellContents>
                        <Textbox Name="Textbox32">
                          <rd:DefaultName>Textbox32</rd:DefaultName>
                          <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
                          <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
                          <Paragraphs>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>14. Warranty. </Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                                    <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>The Supplier warrants that all goods and services match the PO, are free from defects, are fit for purpose, and comply with the law for twelve (12) months from acceptance.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                              </TextRuns>
                              <Style />
                            </Paragraph>
                          </Paragraphs>
                          <Style>
                            <Border>
                              <Style>None</Style>
                            </Border>
                            <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
                            <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
                            <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
                            <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
                          </Style>
                        </Textbox>
                        <ColSpan>3</ColSpan>
                      </CellContents>
                    </TablixCell>
                    <TablixCell />
                    <TablixCell />
                  </TablixCells>
                </TablixRow>
                <TablixRow>
                  <Height>0.74651in</Height>
                  <TablixCells>
                    <TablixCell>
                      <CellContents>
                        <Textbox Name="Textbox98">
                          <rd:DefaultName>Textbox98</rd:DefaultName>
                          <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
                          <Paragraphs>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>15. Ownership, Risk and Licenses. </Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                                    <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>For physical goods, ownership passes to the Buyer on delivery, and risk stays with the Supplier until goods are delivered and accepted. For software, subscriptions, and licenses, the Supplier grants the Buyer the right to use them for the term and number of users stated in the PO, and confirms it has full authority to grant that right. Services must be completed as per the PO scope and are accepted only when the Buyer confirms they are satisfactory.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                              </TextRuns>
                              <Style />
                            </Paragraph>
                          </Paragraphs>
                          <Style>
                            <Border>
                              <Style>None</Style>
                            </Border>
                            <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
                            <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
                            <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
                            <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
                          </Style>
                        </Textbox>
                        <ColSpan>3</ColSpan>
                      </CellContents>
                    </TablixCell>
                    <TablixCell />
                    <TablixCell />
                  </TablixCells>
                </TablixRow>
                <TablixRow>
                  <Height>0.23545in</Height>
                  <TablixCells>
                    <TablixCell>
                      <CellContents>
